     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Dear all,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Michael Schaub, Jose Lahoz-Monfort and I teach a workshop on Integrated Population Models in Melbourne during 22-26 October 2018. In our original post, below, we referred to our advert on the phidot website.\r\n Unfortunately, on phidot Australia (along with parts or all of Asia) belongs to the Axis of Evil Hackers and users with IP addresses on these continents are denied access. Therefore, we here send the announcement again, with a pdf attached.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Thanks for distributing wildly.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\">Best regards  --- Marc<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Von:</span></b><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hmec...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hmec...@googlegroups.com</a>]\r\n<b>Im Auftrag von </b>Schaub Michael<br>\r\n<b>Gesendet:</b> Dienstag, 15. Mai 2018 11:11<br>\r\n<b>An:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hmec...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> Announcement of an IPM workshop<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Good morning,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">here is an announcement of a workshop on integrated population models that will take place in Melbourne, 22-26 October 2018. Please see here\r\n<a href=\"http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewtopic.php?f=8&amp;t=3649&amp;sid=6940b4bfaebb28429a7be4a90f56a5ac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewtopic.php?f%3D8%26t%3D3649%26sid%3D6940b4bfaebb28429a7be4a90f56a5ac&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494712851000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ZTezI-tFHhVC15yRCKmYv\">\r\nhttp://www.phidot.org/forum/viewtopic.php?f=8&amp;t=3649&amp;sid=6940b4bfaebb28429a7be4a90f56a5ac</a>  for details.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE-CH\">Kind regards<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE-CH\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE-CH\">Michael <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE-CH\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE-CH\" style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">________________________________________</span><span lang=\"DE-CH\" style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"DE-CH\" style=\"font-size:8.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Michael Schaub</span><span lang=\"DE-C